     *     <li>"eng" (3-letter language code)</li>
     *     <li>"en_US" (language and country)</li>
     *     <li>"eng_US" (3-letter language and country)</li>
     *     <li>"en_US_POSIX" (language, country, and variant)</li>
     *     <li>"en_US_" (language, country, and empty variant)</li>
     *     <li>"en__POSIX" (language, empty country, and variant)</li>
     *     <li>"en__" (language, empty country, and empty variant)</li>
